    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8235" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεμό-ομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be filled with
				wind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				83d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠνεμωμένος τὴν τρίχα</span>
			<i>with</i> hair <i>floating in the wind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Callistr.
				<u>Stat.</u>
				14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠνεμωμένη πτεροῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					1119
				</span></i>
			: of the sea, <i>to be raised by the wind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				13.12
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Hegesipp.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be inflated, swollen,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				64
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠνεμῶσθαι περί τι</span>
			<i>to be eager</i> for . ., <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				11.7
			</span></i>.</div>
